## What this file covers

Everything in this repository that is **not software**:

- the figures under `figures/`, `plots/` and `figures_for_article/`
- the supplementary tables (`Supplementary File 1–5`, in every dated directory)
- the computed metric tables (`metrics_comprehensive_*.csv`, the long-format
  marker/prediction tables, `Supplementary File 3.csv.gz`)
- the manuscript drafts under `figures_for_article/FL_manuscript_versions/`
- the slide decks under `slides_for_project/`
- the plan, research and documentation Markdown files

