## A note on the software dependencies

The R packages this pipeline calls through `rpy2` (`sva`, `limma`, `FSQN`, `oposSOM`
and others) are GPL-licensed. That affects redistribution of a built Docker *image*
containing them, not the MIT-licensed code in this repository that calls them.
